  <h2>Coaldale roofs take the same beating as Lethbridge</h2>
  <p>Coaldale sits out on the open prairie east of the city, with very little to slow the wind down. Chinook gusts that rip shingles off in Lethbridge hit Coaldale just as hard. Summer hail tracks across the same farmland — when a storm hits the east side of Lethbridge, Coaldale often gets it too.</p>
  <p>That's why we recommend <a href="/architectural-shingles/">architectural shingles</a> for most Coaldale re-roofs. They're thicker, carry a much higher wind rating than 3-tab and hold up better to hail.</p>

